{"id": 51, "name": "Helcurt", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4fcae9e3a7db0bd9f49aea013839d217.png", "cls": ["Assassin", ""], "specialty": ["Push", "Burst"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["30", "50", "50", "50"], "lanes": ["Jungle", "Roam"], "story": "The nightmare of the Abyss who's willing to betray anyone in order to survive.", "skills": [{"name": "Shadow of Styx", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_dc8d2817dd15f112fee407d391b40263.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Helcurt remains in <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Prowler</span> state until spotted by the enemy team, gaining 15% extra Movement Speed, and continuously regenerating <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Total Physical Attack)</span> HP if he has not dealt any damage.\nHe gains 50% extra Attack Speed and 50% extra Movement Speed (decreasing over time) for 4s upon being spotted and leaves <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Prowler</span> state 0.75s later.\nAny hero killed after being hit by Helcurt leaves a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">dark fog</span> that explodes and spreads with a cooldown of 10s. Helcurt <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Conceals</span> himself while within the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">dark fog</span>."}, {"name": "Hidden Terror", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c382e8831549b8418b96bd2bf1a1a747.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 15", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: When Helcurt is in the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Prowler</span> state, <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Terrify</span> also affects enemy heroes hit and briefly reveals them. Its cooldown decreases 3 times as fast as normal.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Helcurt blinks to the target location and deals 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+70% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in the area, reducing their Movement Speed by 60% for 0.75s."}, {"name": "Deadly Stinger", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_488c8c77f2759c625d9b480310190446.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 4", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: Helcurt gains 1 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Deadly Stinger</span> for every 1.5s spent in <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Prowler</span> state or on each Basic Attack. Up to 5 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Deadly Stingers</span> can be stored.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Helcurt fires all <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Deadly Stingers</span> forward, each dealing 180<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies (minions and creeps take only 70% of the damage).\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Deadly Stinger</span> counts as a Basic Attack but cannot Crit."}, {"name": "Dark Night Falls", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_85ec55d4fae0baee5fc5b776963020c5.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 23, "tagname": "Debuff", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 60", "desc": "Helcurt summons the Dark Night, reducing all enemies' sight range and making them lose sight of their allies for 3s. During Dark Night, Helcurt gains 40% extra Movement Speed.\n\nThe Dark Night makes it easier for Helcurt to leave enemies' sight range."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots - Dire Hit", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6e5971b429e55f59cf100d8920cd7c32.png"}, {"name": "Blade of the Heptaseas", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b